{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Greed's Grub </strong>is a first-person <strong>horror game</strong> where you must<strong> craft burgers for nightmarish and goofy customers in a hellish diner,</strong> facing terrifying challenges<strong> for five days</strong> in order to survive.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don\u2019t remember exactly what you did, just that it had to have been <strong>real bad</strong>, if this was your punishment. <strong>Five days of community service</strong> in this <strong>greasy</strong>, <strong>rotting</strong> excuse for a <strong>burger joint</strong>. Just five days, and you\u2019re free. That\u2019s all you have to endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Outlast Your Horrific Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Serve up burgers to the most weirdest and nastiest customers from the depths of hell. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/Gif__1_.gif?t=1744673623\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cook, Cook, Cook.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grill, assemble, and pray for five days straight at a cursed burger joint. Each day is more intense than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/GifTester4__1___1_.gif?t=1744673623\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beware the Boss from Hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The boss is watching, and failure isn\u2019t an option. Keep your grill hot and your wits sharper, or face the consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655930/extras/Gife__1_.gif?t=1744673623\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655930?t=1744673623","background_raw":"https://store